      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DYNAMITE ERIC (3) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth (27.75) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Has ability and is a key runner. PAW MAUD (2) was in winning form two back (32.97) at Traralgon but ran below best last time at this track, finishing 8th. Goes well out of this box with a win and five minor placings. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. ASTON CASTLE (1) wasn't far away at the finish when 5th and beaten only 3.5 lengths (25.85) at Warrnambool. Great chance to atone. BELAIR BETTY (7) cannot be ruled out.",
